> - Takedown/fall down

Already implemented (kind of). The 'pwerful blow' of unarmed monks 
(chance skill/100) throws back monsters by one square and stuns them 
(IIRC), the 'shattering blow' (chance 1/40 if skilled or better) of 
two-handed weapons breaks the monster's weapon and lets it flee. To 
balance the game those might also be implemented in mhitu.c so that 
giants will throw you into lava and Croesus (or captains, ogre kings 
etc) will break your weapon (sounds like fun).


